---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy & Affiliate Disclosure"
  description="How Sawdust & Plans handles affiliate links and site data."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <h1>Privacy &amp; Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Sawdust & Plans participates in affiliate marketing programs, including ClickBank. This means
      that if you click on certain links on this site and make a purchase, we may receive a
      commission at no additional cost to you. Affiliate links are marked as sponsored in accordance
      with FTC guidelines. We only recommend plans and products we believe can genuinely help
      hobbyist woodworkers.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This site does not collect personal information directly. Aggregate, anonymized traffic
      statistics may be collected via a privacy-friendly analytics service. If additional tools are
      added in the future, this page will be updated to reflect what data is collected and how it is
      used.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent via the contact details provided on the About page.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
